abstract: "Open, source-linked pricing data for AI tools. Every row records the vendor page it was read from and the date it was last checked; prices a vendor does not publish clearly are left blank. Rows are read by an AI assistant and run through automated checks, not hand-checked one by one."
keywords:
  - AI tools
  - pricing
  - open data
